# Real portfolio data and broker statements. These are personal financial
# records, not fixtures — `data/` holds the live portfolio.json and the local
# SQLite, and the LedgerReport PDFs are IWT account statements. They were
# untracked but not ignored, so a stray `git add -A` would have committed them.
data/
LedgerReport-*.pdf
# Broker statement PDFs and anything the importer derives from them.
statements/
*-bundle.json
statement-bundle.json
